{
  "info": {
    "name": "Decidiq Delegation and Mandate Register Anon-Read Contract Suite",
    "description": "Newman contract tests for change delegatie-mandaatregister (REQ-DMR-002, REQ-DMR-005). The authority-delegation schema grants the public group read access while publicationDate <= now and no depublicationDate has passed, on the live object. Asserts: a published delegation is anonymously readable with its public fields; an unpublished one is not returned; anonymous writes are refused; a withdrawal shows on the next anonymous read with no republish step; withdrawn is terminal; depublication removes it from the anonymous list.\n\nAUTH MODEL (same as decidiq-publication-anon-read): collection auth is noauth; every admin request carries an explicit basic-auth block plus 'OCS-APIRequest: true'; anonymous requests go to {{noAuthBase}}, a different host alias, so no session cookie reaches them.\n\nSpec: openspec/changes/delegatie-mandaatregister/specs/delegatie-mandaatregister/spec.md",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "item": [
